        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Energy Production in France vs Germany (2020)</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqPldEHP5oO9Eqxr2kRlefpxgtb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QdMMd4G4zoOjwaxyvOqlKyZjgWf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/task-1-pie-charts\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Giới thiệu dạng Pie Charts</a></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PIEldYEzioYZTdxhKifl1hNeg7d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Energy Production in France vs Germany: 2020 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về phần trăm sản xuất năng lượng từ c&aacute;c nguồn kh&aacute;c nhau tại France v&agrave; Germany trong năm 2020.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<p><em><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span class=\"cf0\">(*) Học </span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/124/ielts-writing-task-1-aim-6570-internal?collection=lesson&amp;item=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"cf0\">c</span><span class=\"cf1\">&aacute;ch t</span><span class=\"cf0\">ả số liệu \"t</span><span class=\"cf2\">ương đối\"</span><span class=\"cf0\"> v&agrave; paraphrase cấu tr</span><span class=\"cf1\">&uacute;c c&acirc;u</span></a></span><span class=\"cf1\"> tr</span><span class=\"cf3\">ư</span><span class=\"cf0\">ớc khi viết b&agrave;i, v&igrave;</span><span class=\"cf4\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"cf3\">đ</span><span class=\"cf1\">&acirc;y l&agrave; k</span><span class=\"cf0\">ỹ n</span><span class=\"cf2\">ăng vi</span><span class=\"cf0\">ết v</span><span class=\"cf1\">&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan tr</span><span class=\"cf0\">ọng </span><span class=\"cf2\">đ</span><span class=\"cf0\">ể d</span><span class=\"cf1\">&ugrave;ng trong c</span><span class=\"cf0\">ả b</span><span class=\"cf1\">&agrave;i viết.</span></span></em><!--StartFragment --></p>\n<!--EndFragment --></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong><!--StartFragment --></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"pf0\"><sp