ref=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-pie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"cf0\">c</span><span class=\"cf1\">&aacute;ch vi</span><span class=\"cf0\">ết Introduction dạng Pie Chart</span></a></span></span></em></span></p>\n<p><!--EndFragment --></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BpnwdjQABoPoN8x8rWolExaGgkc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TNQbdAcxMoW5dYxNrjZlSg8rg9g\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề kh&ocirc;ng thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TNQbdAcxMoW5dYxNrjZlSg8rg9g\"><!--StartFragment -->\n<ul>\n<li class=\"pf0\"><span class=\"cf0\">Hầu hết n</span><span class=\"cf1\">ăng lư</span><span class=\"cf0\">ợng </span><span class=\"cf1\">đư</span><span class=\"cf0\">ợc tạo ra ở hai quốc gia n</span><span class=\"cf2\">&agrave;y </span><span class=\"cf3\">đ</span><span class=\"cf0\">ến từ chỉ n</span><span class=\"cf1\">ăm ngu</span><span class=\"cf0\">ồn.</span></li>\n<li class=\"pf0\"><span class=\"cf0\">Gas, nuclear and solar power l</span><span class=\"cf2\">&agrave; nh</span><span class=\"cf0\">ững nguồn quan trọng nhất.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<!--EndFragment --></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">Theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MBsEd5P1wom7Csxp1lQlLP0CgJh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O03XdVrGmo73CoxStuLlzZWjg9c\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> M&ocirc; tả số liệu của Gas, Solar power v&agrave; Nuclear power</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A7NtdfRyhoPLuLx4tXyld0Qrg0g\">Theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A7NtdfRyhoPLuLx4tXyld0Qrg0g\"><!--StartFragment -->\n<ul>\n<li class=\"pf0\"><strong><span class=\"cf0\">B</span><span class=\"cf1\">ư</span></strong><span class=\"cf0\"><strong>ớc 1:</strong> So s</span><span class=\"cf2\">&aacute;nh 2 n</span><span class=\"cf3\">ư</span><span class=\"cf0\">ớc về số liệu của gas <em>(France l</em></span><em><span class=\"cf2\">&agrave; 30%, cao h</span><span class=\"cf3\">ơn Germany 5%)</span></em></li>\n<li class=\"pf0\"><strong><span class=\"cf3\">Bư</span></strong><span class=\"cf0\"><strong>ớc 2:</strong> So s</span><span class=\"cf2\">&aacute;nh 2 n</span><span class=\"cf3\">ư</span><span class=\"cf0\">ớc về số liệu của solar power <em>(Germany l</em></span><em><span class=\"cf2\">&agrave; 28%, France kho</span><span class=\"cf0\">ảng 25%)</span></em></li>\n<li class=\"pf0\"><strong><span class=\"cf0\">B</span><span class=\"cf1\">ư</span></strong><span class=\"cf0\"><strong>ớc 3:</strong> So s</span><span class=\"cf2\">&aacute;nh 2 n</span><span class=\"cf3\">ư</span><span class=\"cf0\">ớc về số liệu của nuclear power&nbsp;<em>(France l</em></span><em><span class=\"cf2\">&agrave; 25%, cao h</span><span class=\"cf3\">ơn 18% c</span><span class=\"cf0\">ủa Germany)</span></em></li>\n</ul>\n<!--EndFragment --></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CZq5ddsBOoOoOZx7FbilggOFgAg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SpTPdP8k2oV6oixoA9ulA6Qcg3c\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2:</strong><strong> M&ocirc; tả c&aacute;c yếu tố c&ograve;n lại - Petrol, coal v&agrave; other</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GDTZdY4fko7MFnxcM3eleZMKgDQ\">Theo<strong> </strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GDTZdY4fko7MFnxcM3eleZMKgDQ\"><!--StartFragment -->\n<ul>\n<li class=\"pf0\"><strong><span class=\"cf0\">B</span><span class=\"cf1\">ư</span></strong><span class=\"cf0\"><strong>ớc 1:</strong> So s</span><span class=\"cf2\">&aacute;nh 2 n</span><span class=\"cf3\">ư</span><span class=\"cf0\">ớc về số liệu của petrol v</span><span class=\"cf2\">&agrave; coal <em>(France l&agrave; 14% v&agrave; 10%, trong khi </em></span><em><span class=\"cf3\">đ</span><span class=\"cf2\">&oacute; Germany l&agrave; 4% v&agrave; 3%, theo th</span><span class=\"cf0\">ứ tự </span><span class=\"cf1\">đ</span><span class=\"cf2\">&oacute;)</span></em></li>\n<li class=\"pf0\"><strong><span class=\"cf2\">B</span><span class=\"cf3\">ư</span></strong><span class=\"cf0\"><strong>ớc 2:</strong> So s</span><span class=\"cf2\">&aacute;nh 2 n</span><span class=\"cf3\">ư</span><span class=\"cf0\">ớc về số liệu của other <em>(trong khoảng từ 3% </em></span><em><span class=\"cf1\">đ</span><span class=\"cf0\">ến 5%)</span></em></li>\n</ul>\n<!--EndFragment --></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOGCdDfzMo4b0vxNcTDlMZwkgW6\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\"